# tally 2.1.7 S7 (X1, pre-M1 P4 on #97): L §8.4 RUN-DOMAIN `a stepped range whose step <s> is not positive`, for a
# range of days as for numbers: q steps 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31 by st * 1 day, with st = 0; n steps 0.5 .. 2.5 by
# -0.5. Was (2.1.6): q printed `a stepped range whose step is not positive`, without its <s>.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input st: int
input fr: num

ask q: sum(1 for d in 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31 step st * 1 day)
ask n: sum(1 for f in 0.5 .. 2.5 step fr)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  st = 0 "s"
  fr = -0.5 "s"
=== expect
n: refused: RUN-DOMAIN a stepped range whose step -0.5 is not positive
  cut 2026-10-18
q: refused: RUN-DOMAIN a stepped range whose step 0 day is not positive
  cut 2026-10-18
